{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your father once built a vast business empire.<br>A single betrayal shattered it, splitting everything into five publicly listed companies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, you return to the market from the very bottom.<br>Through stocks, real estate, and company investments, you slowly accumulate capital.<br>Your goal is clear from the start \u2014<br><strong>buy out and fully take control of those five companies, and complete a long-overdue reckoning.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stock Trading</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy low and sell high by riding market volatility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Influence market sentiment and price movements through covert actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Privatize companies to secure stable, long-term cash flow.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Industry Chain Management</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand production chains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep assets running and generating continuous income.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Estate Investment</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase properties and rent them out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn stable rental income as market conditions evolve.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Open Account","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956440/066cf07ed44de4a8a9d0b1e10f3f22561e898d54.jpg"},{"name":"Minor Shareholder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956440/225a36cf76152a11d4d7769a8cdd084d6a8833a3.jpg"},{"name":"Major Shareholder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956440/60d5d5ecf18bd113089a872a183760e846ba3086.jpg"},{"name":"Full Privatization","p